# cards: Namia's basic version (docs/plan-cards.md 3.1). Lucia (level 1, Divine Rain not learned) wears Namia
# (219, points 0x020B488A) at 1300. Round 1: Jian Fights; Lucia's card entry (all allies, no picker): the battle
# flags word (the battle work's first word, its pointer at 0x020B8550, 0x02282940 in this battle) gets Divine Rain's 5% bit 0x10, not
# Namia's 10% bit 0x08; points 1300 -> 1200.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213BA0A 1
poke u16 0x020B488A 1300
poke u16 0x020B46FE 219
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8550 work_ptr
watch u32 0x02282940 battle_flags
watch u16 0x020B488A points
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
shot cn_pick
press A 8
wait 1300
shot cn_after
